{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26319","headline":"赠边将 · 施肩吾","name":"赠边将","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻生奉国不爲难，战苦身多旧箭瘢。\n玉匣锁龙鳞甲冷，金铃衬鹘羽毛寒。\n皂貂拥出花当背，白马骑来月在鞍。\n犹恐犬戎临虏塞，柳营时把阵图看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}